%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Stoat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 15
  entries:
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Catch Orbit
    AbilityDescription: 'Triggers. Press LT or RT and a light black hole and its white hole are laid ahead of you,
      the black hole on the pressed side. Fly past it and it catches you onto an orbit: hold to go
      round it, squeeze harder for a tighter circle, and let go to fly out along the tangent. The
      pair then falls together and annihilates, throwing the Charge ripple. A pair you own never
      pulls you in. Space is the pair''s reach - one dial, read live: the orbit''s radius x1 ->
      x1.4 at level 10 (StoatSlingConfigSO.orbitReach). R_VesselActions/STOAT_DIPOLE.md section
      1b.'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Accretion
    UpgradeDescription: 'Parked with the field dipole: no effect while the Stoat flies the orbit alone. With the
      dipole back, what its sink swallows is yours and grows both poles
      (Docs/Studios/STOAT_FIELD_TRAJECTORY_PARKED.md).'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Timed Slingshot
    AbilityDescription: 'Passive speed. While a pair is held your flight clock warps and you fly faster: x2.7 at
      rest. Let go a quarter-turn after the catch (90 deg +- 15) for the whole slingshot kick, a
      fifth of it outside that window; the orbit''s dotted circle turns lime inside it. Time is
      rate - one dial, the Stoat''s boost: the warp x2.7 at rest -> x5.6 at level 10
      (StoatDipoleConfigSO.boost x StoatSlingConfigSO.catchWarpShare), and the slingshot''s kick
      by the same ratio (BoostRatio, x1 -> x2).'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Foresight
    UpgradeDescription: 'You also see the predicted paths of the three nearest rivals within 1500 u, in their domain
      colours - each flown 500 u forward on the turn and speed it is holding right now, measured
      from its pose (no input needed). Read a rival''s line and lay your pair across it. Gated on
      IsUpgradeActive(Time), replicated; drawn for the local pilot only
      (StoatPathfinderExecutor.Foresight).'
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Ripple
    AbilityDescription: 'Passive, anti-vessel and anti-creature. Every pair of yours that annihilates - a
      dipole let go, an orbit''s pair closing after its slingshot - throws a SPACE-TIME
      RIPPLE from where the poles met: a spherical wave that bends the scene as it passes.
      Where its front sweeps over them, rival vessels are STRIPPED of one whole petal of
      every element they hold (shed as crystals around them; a ward against blasts stops
      it) and creatures are killed. It touches no prism, and never you or a teammate. The
      ripple''s reach is the separation the poles had when you let go (x0.6, 30 -> 160 u)
      - Charge scales it x1 -> x2 at level 10 (StoatRippleConfigSO.reach, replicated
      level).'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Siphon
    UpgradeDescription: 'The petals the ripple strips come straight to YOU instead of being shed as crystals
      - a rival''s level becomes yours. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Charge), replicated, so
      every peer moves the same petals (StoatRippleConfigSO.siphonOnChargeUpgrade).'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Orbit Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'Parked: the Stoat flies the orbit alone, so B switches nothing and your trail is laid at its
      own thickness at every Mass level. Mass mode''s thick trail and Gate mode''s warp gate come
      back with the field trajectory (Docs/Studios/STOAT_FIELD_TRAJECTORY_PARKED.md).'
    Input: 7
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Armoured Wake
    UpgradeDescription: 'Parked with Mass mode: no effect while the Stoat flies the orbit alone. With Mass mode back,
      every prism laid in it arrives shielded (Docs/Studios/STOAT_FIELD_TRAJECTORY_PARKED.md).'
  omniAbilityLabel: Overclock
